OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners call for new body to
OL,4,Alead Mackintosh Building restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FResponsibility for rebuilding the
OL,7,Ffire-damaged Mackintosh Building should
OL,8,Fbe transferred from Glasgow School of
OL,9,FArt (GSA) to a new independent body,
OL,10,Fcampaigners have said.
OL,12,FThe Charles Rennie Mackintosh Society
OL,13,Fsaid a special-purpose organisation
OL,14,Fwould be better placed to lead
OL,15,Ffundraising, governance and
OL,16,Freconstruction of the landmark, which
OL,17,Fwas devastated by fires in 2014 and
OL,18,F2018.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
