OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners call for new body to
OL,4,Alead Mackintosh Building restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn July, GSA said the estimated cost of
OL,7,Fa faithful restoration had soared to
OL,8,F#265m and warned it could not proceed
OL,9,Fwithout significant extra financial
OL,10,Fsupport.
OL,12,FThe art school said it would invest
OL,13,Finsurance settlement funds in
OL,14,Fpreparatory works but full
OL,15,Freinstatement would require external
OL,16,Fpartners and funding.
